<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="ko" xmlns:th="http://www.thymeleaf.org"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>로그인 · DebugMate</title><link rel="stylesheet" th:href="@{/css/app.css(v='20261029-3')}"><script defer th:src="@{/js/app.js(v='20261029-3')}"></script></head><body class="auth-page"><main class="auth-shell"><a class="brand auth-brand" th:href="@{/login}"><span class="brand-mark">D</span><span>DebugMate</span></a><section class="auth-card"><p class="eyebrow">WELCOME BACK</p><h1>로그인</h1><p class="auth-copy">오류 해결 기록과 현상금 커뮤니티를 이용하려면 로그인하세요.</p><div class="flash" th:if="${message}" th:text="${message}"></div><div class="auth-error" th:if="${error}" th:text="${error}"></div><form class="form-stack" th:action="@{/login}" method="post"><div class="field"><label for="email">이메일</label><input id="email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required placeholder="name@example.com"></div><div class="field"><label for="password">비밀번호</label><input id="password" name="password" type="password" autocomplete="current-password" required placeholder="8자 이상"></div><button class="button primary full" type="submit">로그인</button></form><p class="auth-switch">아직 계정이 없나요? <a th:href="@{/signup}">회원가입</a></p></section></main></body></html>
